            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Susie C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "An outstanding vinaigrette with ingredients as is!! With a good quality balsamic, totally only need a touch of honey I do like taking my emersion blender to it which creates creamy, smooth version. Nom! 😀. This will still separate and you still gotta give it a little shakey, shakey before using.",
