              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CopperMixer3063"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Super good! Used it on a pasta &amp; chickpea salad. Added 1/8 tsp red pepper flakes ( that mum recently brought back from Southern Italy) and and 1/2 tsp oregano that was dehydrated from our garden. Used the Kirkland aged balsamic vinegar.",
            "datePublished": "2023-11-08T00:38:04.447Z"
