              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ShariAnn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is an easy, tasty, must try dressing! You'll never buy store bought again. I followed the directions, yet added two tablespoons of mayonnaise and used an immersion blender to blend it into a creamy dressing. It was absolutely delicious!",
